{"html": "<div class=\"nhead\">いまの指標の位置（主要7＋準主要7指標）</div><div class=\"mlegend\"><span style=\"background:#b9dcc0\">安心・標準</span><span style=\"background:#c9dcf3\">魅力あり（要確認）</span><span style=\"background:#f5e6b3\">注意</span><span style=\"background:#f2c4a8\">警戒</span><span style=\"background:#eeeae0\">中立</span></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">RSI(14)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:30.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:60.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">60</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ボリンジャー</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:16.7%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:83.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:94.8%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+2.7σ</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">25日線乖離</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:25.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:25.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:55.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:75.0%; width:25.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:89.1%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+5.6%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MACD</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:50.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">買い転換</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">50/200日線</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:75.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">GC</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">支持帯の試し</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:60.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">6回目</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">20日高値から</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:13.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:53.3%; width:46.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:0.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">−0.0%</span></div><div class=\"msub\">準主要指標（補助的に見る）</div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ストキャス</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:40.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:80.0%; width:20.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:67.9%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">68</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MFI</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:40.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:80.0%; width:20.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:57.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">57</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ADX(トレンド強さ)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:8.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:41.7%; width:58.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:24.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">15↑</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">一目・雲</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:83.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">雲の上</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ATR(日々の値幅)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:15.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:35.0%; width:15.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:19.8%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">2.0%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">HV(年率変動)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.8%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.8%; width:12.5%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:16.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">20%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">OBV(20日)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:10.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:51.5%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+2%</span></div></div><div class=\"discnote\">ピンが現在値。PER・PBRなど価値系は「標準」が最も安心、割安は魅力だが「割安の罠」の確認が必要。RSI・ボリンジャーなど行きすぎ系は売られすぎ側が押し目買いに有利。読み方は「指標の読み方」ページへ。</div><div class=\"nhead\">スコア 114点（候補圏外）</div><div class=\"reason\">・直近20日高値から −0.0%（安さの主基準 +0点・8%で頭打ち）</div><div class=\"reason\">・下げが複数日に分散した「じわ下げ」で、1日の急落で作られた安さではない（+15点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・日々の値動きが±1.2%と穏やかで読みやすい（+10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・200日平均線より上での下げ＝上昇トレンド中の一時的な押し目（+20点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・1年高値からの下落 −4% で長期トレンド健全（+12点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・過去1年、同じ買い方で 3回 利確ライン（+5%）に到達（+15点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・長期支持帯 2,879円付近は過去5回試されており、今回で6回目。支持線は試されるほど割れやすい（−5点・警戒）</div><div class=\"reason\">・50日線が200日線の上（ゴールデンクロス継続中の長期上昇形 +10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・W底（ダブルボトム）を形成しネックライン3,060円を上抜け（+8点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・直近に出来高急増+長い下ヒゲ（セリングクライマックス=投げ売り一巡の兆候 +6点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・MACDが直近5日以内に買い転換（下げの勢いが尽きた定番シグナル +8点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・一目均衡表の雲の上（中期の地合いは良好 +4点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・ATR 2.0%と日々の値幅が小さく、損切り幅を狭く置ける（+3点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・ファンダ指標が本日取得できず中立扱い（加減点なし）</div><div class=\"reason\">・夜間ギャップ（翌朝の窓開け）平均±0.6%と小さく、夜に決めた指値が翌朝も有効に働きやすい（+8点）</div><div class=\"nhead\">減点方式: 全体848位（−16点）</div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevB\">重い</span>売買代金が1日1億円未満（約定しにくい）<span class=\"num hp\">−10</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>ボリンジャー+2σ超（統計的な買われすぎ）<span class=\"num hp\">−6</span></div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"41.3\" width=\"320\" height=\"15.700000000000003\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,48.8 9.1,43.6 14.2,56.8 19.3,53.9 24.5,66.4 29.6,60.3 34.7,59.3 39.8,66.2 44.9,64.8 50.0,57.6 55.1,45.5 60.3,34.8 65.4,14.4 70.5,34.2 75.6,30.7 80.7,29.8 85.8,30.6 91.0,36.7 96.1,43.7 101.2,32.4 106.3,29.7 111.4,27.3 116.5,35.4 121.6,24.6 126.8,12.8 131.9,14.9 137.0,17.6 142.1,16.0 147.2,37.1 152.3,44.6 157.4,41.5 162.6,35.4 167.7,39.6 172.8,51.0 177.9,56.8 183.0,56.4 188.1,76.8 193.2,74.5 198.4,75.4 203.5,65.0 208.6,83.7 213.7,75.1 218.8,88.5 223.9,94.6 229.0,96.7 234.2,94.3 239.3,97.2 244.4,90.6 249.5,71.8 254.6,73.0 259.7,71.3 264.9,65.9 270.0,42.4 275.1,40.0 280.2,29.6 285.3,38.7 290.4,33.4 295.5,33.4 300.7,25.6 305.8,36.4 310.9,32.1 316.0,14.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 60.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 96.1 55.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 116.5 47.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 162.6 47.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 285.3 50.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fil